# Phase 6: URL Parameter Sanitizer Patch
# Target: X/UEU.smali LIZLLL method
# Location: smali_classes15/X/UEU.smali starting at line 3864
# Date: 2025-10-20

## Changes Summary
- Strips all query parameters (everything after '?') from canonical URLs
- Removes tracking: utm_*, share_*, _d, _r, etc.
- Returns clean URLs: https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/ID

## Register Allocation
- v0: int (indexOf result)
- v1: String (URL - modified in-place)
- v2: String (const-string literals)
- v3: String (log messages)

## Method Signature
.method public static final LIZLLL(ILjava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)LX/Wu4;
    .registers 8  # Changed from 6 to 8 for additional local registers

## Patch Code (Insert after line 3882 - LIZLLL_RESULT log)

```smali
    # PHASE 6: URL Parameter Sanitizer - Strip everything after '?'
    const-string v2, "URL_BEFORE_CLEAN"
    invoke-static {v2, v1}, Landroid/util/Log;->d(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)I

    # Find '?' character (use v0 for int result)
    const-string v2, "?"
    invoke-virtual {v1, v2}, Ljava/lang/String;->indexOf(Ljava/lang/String;)I
    move-result v0

    # Skip cleaning if no '?' or '?' at position 0 (v0 <= 0)
    if-lez v0, :url_already_clean

    # Substring from 0 to '?' position
    const/4 v2, 0x0
    invoke-virtual {v1, v2, v0}, Ljava/lang/String;->substring(II)Ljava/lang/String;
    move-result-object v1

    # Log sanitization (only when actually cleaned)
    const-string v2, "SANITIZER"
    const-string v3, "Tracking parameters removed"
    invoke-static {v2, v3}, Landroid/util/Log;->d(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)I

    :url_already_clean
    const-string v2, "URL_AFTER_CLEAN"
    invoke-static {v2, v1}, Landroid/util/Log;->d(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)I

    # Continue to shortened-URL checks
    goto :check_shortened
```

## Integration Notes

1. **Prerequisites**:
   - Phase 5 logging infrastructure already in place
   - Method has .registers 8 (modified from original 6)

2. **Flow**:
   - Line 3864: `move-result-object v1` (URL from UEa.LIZ shortener)
   - Line 3882: Log LIZLLL_RESULT
   - **INSERT PATCH HERE**
   - Line 3918+: :check_shortened (vm./vt. detection)
   - Line 3941+: :keep_shortened_c
   - Line 3943+: TextUtils.isEmpty check

3. **Label Safety**:
   - New label `:url_already_clean` does not conflict with existing labels
   - Existing labels: :log_null_result, :check_shortened, :swap_canonical_c, :keep_shortened_c

4. **Type Safety**:
   - v0 exclusively used for int (indexOf result, startsWith results)
   - v1 exclusively String (URL throughout)
   - v2 exclusively String (const-string, then reused)
   - v3 exclusively String (log messages, boolean results from startsWith)

## Test Results

**Expected Logcat Output**:
```
D/URL_BEFORE_CLEAN: https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/123?utm_source=copy&...
D/SANITIZER: Tracking parameters removed
D/URL_AFTER_CLEAN: https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/123
```

**Edge Cases Handled**:
- ✅ URL without `?` → indexOf returns -1 → if-lez jumps → no substring → URL unchanged
- ✅ URL with `?` at position 0 → indexOf returns 0 → if-lez jumps → URL unchanged
- ✅ URL with `?` at position > 0 → substring(0, index) → tracking removed
- ✅ Null URL → handled by earlier :log_null_result guard

